WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.421 --> 00:00:03.275
打开 Settings / Open Settings

2
00:00:03.275 --> 00:00:06.417
找到 MCP Server / Find MCP Server

3
00:00:06.417 --> 00:00:09.327
开启本机 MCP Server / Enable the local MCP Server

4
00:00:09.327 --> 00:00:12.266
添加独立 Client / Add a separate Client

5
00:00:12.266 --> 00:00:15.117
输入 Guide local client / Name the Client

6
00:00:15.117 --> 00:00:18.067
创建 Client / Create the Client

7
00:00:18.067 --> 00:00:21.368
复制配置，不展示凭据 / Copy configuration without displaying credentials

8
00:00:21.368 --> 00:00:24.367
演示客户端连接并查询 / Connect the demo client and query

9
00:00:24.367 --> 00:00:27.278
发起需要审批的操作 / Request an operation requiring approval

10
00:00:27.278 --> 00:00:30.168
拒绝一次操作 / Deny the operation

11
00:00:30.168 --> 00:00:33.017
再次请求并检查影响 / Request again and review effects

12
00:00:33.017 --> 00:00:35.917
允许暂停录制 / Allow pausing Recording

13
00:00:35.917 --> 00:00:38.868
查看 Client 的 Auto 模式 / Inspect Client Auto mode

14
00:00:38.868 --> 00:00:41.716
恢复 Client 的 Ask / Restore Client Ask

15
00:00:41.716 --> 00:00:44.618
检查轮换凭据确认 / Review credential rotation

16
00:00:44.618 --> 00:00:47.568
轮换凭据并验证旧配置失效 / Rotate and verify old configuration is rejected

17
00:00:47.568 --> 00:00:50.666
复制新配置并重新连接 / Copy new configuration and reconnect

18
00:00:50.666 --> 00:00:53.568
查看撤销 Client 的确认 / Review Client revocation

19
00:00:53.568 --> 00:00:56.468
撤销演示 Client / Revoke the demo Client

20
00:00:56.468 --> 00:00:59.418
关闭 MCP Server / Disable MCP Server

21
00:00:59.418 --> 00:01:02.368
观察端口冲突提示 / Observe an endpoint conflict

22
00:01:02.368 --> 00:01:05.319
结束已知占用后重试 / Retry after ending the known port owner

23
00:01:05.319 --> 00:01:08.234
结束演示并关闭 Server / Finish by disabling the Server
